"var Component=(()=>{var u=Object.create;var s=Object.defineProperty;var m=Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor;var y=Object.getOwnPropertyNames;var p=Object.getPrototypeOf,f=Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty;var g=(n,e)=>()=>(e||n((e={exports:{}}).exports,e),e.exports),w=(n,e)=>{for(var o in e)s(n,o,{get:e[o],enumerable:!0})},r=(n,e,o,h)=>{if(e&&typeof e==\"object\"||typeof e==\"function\")for(let i of y(e))!f.call(n,i)&&i!==o&&s(n,i,{get:()=>e[i],enumerable:!(h=m(e,i))||h.enumerable});return n};var b=(n,e,o)=>(o=n!=null?u(p(n)):{},r(e||!n||!n.__esModule?s(o,\"default\",{value:n,enumerable:!0}):o,n)),v=n=>r(s({},\"__esModule\",{value:!0}),n);var l=g((x,a)=>{a.exports=_jsx_runtime});var k={};w(k,{default:()=>c});var t=b(l());function d(n){let e={blockquote:\"blockquote\",em:\"em\",h1:\"h1\",h2:\"h2\",hr:\"hr\",li:\"li\",ol:\"ol\",p:\"p\",strong:\"strong\",ul:\"ul\",...n.components};return(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.h1,{children:\"Observing the Quiet Details\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"A meditation on the small things we walk past, and what it costs us to keep walking\"})}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"There is a version of your day happening right now that you are not seeing. Not because it's hidden \\u2014 because it's quiet. The way light pools on the floor and moves an inch every hour. The sound your house makes when everyone in it finally falls asleep. The exact second a stranger's expression changes before they decide to smile at you. None of this asks for your attention. That's precisely why it never gets any.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"To observe the quiet details is to interrupt that pattern \\u2014 on purpose, gently, again and again \\u2014 until noticing becomes less like an event and more like a way of being present.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:\"The Loud World Trains Us to Miss the Quiet One\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"Most of what competes for our attention is built to be loud: headlines, notifications, arguments, deadlines. Loudness has a head start. It arrives first and takes the seat closest to the door. Quiet details, by contrast, never compete \\u2014 they simply wait, and if you don't turn toward them, they don't insist.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"This means observation is not a talent some people are born with. It's closer to an \",(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"undoing\"}),\" \\u2014 unlearning the habit of scanning only for what shouts.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.blockquote,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\"\\u0920\\u0939\\u0930 \\u091C\\u093E\\u0913 \\u091C\\u093C\\u0930\\u093E, \\u0939\\u0935\\u093E \\u092D\\u0940 \\u0915\\u0941\\u091B \\u0915\\u0939\\u0924\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948,'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\\u0939\\u0930 \\u092A\\u0924\\u094D\\u0924\\u093E \\u0917\\u093F\\u0930\\u0924\\u093E \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, \\u0915\\u094B\\u0908 \\u0915\\u0939\\u093E\\u0928\\u0940 \\u0915\\u0939\\u0924\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\"'})]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"(Pause for a moment \\u2014 even the wind has something to say; not every leaf simply falls, some fall telling a story.)\"})}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:'What Counts as a \"Quiet Detail\"'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"It helps to name them, because once named, they become easier to find:\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.ul,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"The after-moment\"}),\" \\u2014 not the door slamming, but the way the room settles once it has.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"The unconscious gesture\"}),\" \\u2014 someone adjusting a photo frame slightly straighter without noticing they've done it.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"The texture beneath the obvious\"}),' \\u2014 not \"the old house,\" but the specific give of a floorboard that has learned exactly where you step.']}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"The almost-said\"}),\" \\u2014 a sentence someone starts and quietly decides not to finish.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"The object that outlives its owner's attention\"}),\" \\u2014 a coat still hung by the door months after it stopped being worn.\"]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"None of these are dramatic. That is the entire point. Drama announces itself; these details have to be \",(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"found\"}),\".\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:\"Why Bother Noticing What Barely Happened\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"It would be easy to dismiss this kind of attention as precious or unproductive \\u2014 why watch dust turn in the light when there is so much to do? But the quiet details are where most of our actual lives are stored. We remember the shape of our grandmother's hands more clearly than the last thing she said to us. We remember the smell of a particular rain more vividly than the news that was playing when it fell.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"The large events of a life are rare. The quiet details are constant. If you only pay attention to the large events, you will find, looking back, that most of your life feels like it is missing.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.blockquote,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\"\\u091C\\u093C\\u0930\\u094D\\u0930\\u0947 \\u091C\\u093C\\u0930\\u094D\\u0930\\u0947 \\u092E\\u0947\\u0902 \\u091B\\u0941\\u092A\\u093E \\u0939\\u0948 \\u090F\\u0915 \\u091C\\u0939\\u093E\\u0928 \\u092A\\u0942\\u0930\\u093E,'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\\u092C\\u0938 \\u0926\\u0947\\u0916\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093E\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0906\\u0901\\u0916 \\u0925\\u094B\\u0921\\u093C\\u0940 \\u0917\\u0939\\u0930\\u0940 \\u0939\\u094B\\u0964\"'})]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"(A whole universe hides in every grain of dust \\u2014 the eye that looks simply needs to look a little deeper.)\"})}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:\"The Threshold Is Where the Quiet Lives\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"The stillest, most charged moments are usually thresholds \\u2014 the instant \",(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"before\"}),\" something becomes itself. The pause before rain. The breath before a name is spoken. The half-second after truth leaves someone's mouth, before their face decides how to respond to having said it.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:'Nothing has technically \"happened\" yet in these moments. And yet they often hold more than the event they precede.'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.blockquote,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\"\\u092C\\u093E\\u0930\\u093F\\u0936 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092A\\u0939\\u0932\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0940 \\u0935\\u094B \\u0916\\u093C\\u093E\\u092E\\u094B\\u0936\\u0940,'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\\u0905\\u0932\\u094D\\u092B\\u093C\\u093E\\u091C\\u093C\\u094B\\u0902 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u091C\\u093C\\u094D\\u092F\\u093E\\u0926\\u093E \\u0915\\u0941\\u091B \\u0915\\u0939\\u0924\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\"'})]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"(That silence just before the rain \\u2014 it says more than words ever could.)\"})}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:\"A Small, Repeatable Practice\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"Observation is trainable, the same way a muscle is. A few ways to begin:\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.ol,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Give one object ninety extra seconds.\"}),\" A spoon, a doorframe, your own hand resting on a table. Most people look for two seconds. Try staying long enough to notice it change.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Follow an ending past its end.\"}),\" When a sound or action finishes, don't look away immediately \\u2014 watch what the space does with the silence that follows.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Replace the first word with the true one.\"}),' Instead of \"beautiful\" or \"sad,\" find the specific, physical fact that made you reach for that word in the first place.']}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.li,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.strong,{children:\"Ask what a thing has witnessed\"}),\", not what it means. A worn staircase doesn't need a metaphor \\u2014 it needs someone to notice how it has been shaped by footsteps it will never remember individually.\"]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.h2,{children:\"Closing: A Life Made of What You Chose to See\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[\"Observing the quiet details doesn't make life slower. It makes it \",(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"wider\"}),\" \\u2014 the same twenty-four hours holding more, simply because more of it was seen. You don't need new experiences to feel that your days are fuller. You need, often, only to look thirty seconds longer at the ones you already have.\"]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.blockquote,{children:[`\n`,(0,t.jsxs)(e.p,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\"\\u0936\\u093E\\u092F\\u0930\\u0940 \\u0915\\u094B\\u0908 \\u092B\\u093C\\u0928 \\u0928\\u0939\\u0940\\u0902, \\u092C\\u0938 \\u090F\\u0915 \\u0928\\u093F\\u0917\\u093E\\u0939 \\u0939\\u0948,'}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:'\\u091C\\u094B \\u0939\\u0930 \\u0916\\u093C\\u093E\\u092E\\u094B\\u0936 \\u0932\\u092E\\u094D\\u0939\\u0947 \\u092E\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092D\\u0940, \\u0915\\u0941\\u091B \\u0915\\u0939\\u0924\\u0940 \\u091A\\u093E\\u0939 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964\"'})]}),`\n`]}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"(Poetry isn't a craft \\u2014 it's simply a way of looking, one that finds something worth saying even in the quietest moment.)\"})}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:\"Somewhere near you, right now, something ordinary is quietly happening for the only time it ever will. It isn't hiding. It's just waiting to see if you'll turn your head.\"}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.hr,{}),`\n`,(0,t.jsx)(e.p,{children:(0,t.jsx)(e.em,{children:\"Tomorrow, choose one thing you'd normally walk past. Give it thirty extra seconds. See what it was trying to say.\"})})]})}function c(n={}){let{wrapper:e}=n.components||{};return e?(0,t.jsx)(e,{...n,children:(0,t.jsx)(d,{...n})}):d(n)}return v(k);})();\n;return Component;"